case "Local false wins equal-time positive ServiceRequest":
- subject is "Sample Patient".
- fact is "Ind Vision Dermatochalasis".
- fact is "Complaint Vision Interference".
- fact is "Demo Photo Margin".
- fact is "Photographs Conform".
- fact is "Cosmetic Purpose No".
